{"index":0,"content":"\n\n<think>\n\n</think>\n\n健康减重的核心在于制造合理的热量缺口，而非盲目追求快速掉秤。\n建议将每周运动频率设定为三到五次，结合有氧运动与力量训练以提升代谢。\n有氧运动如慢跑或游泳每次持续三十分钟以上，能有效燃烧脂肪并增强心肺功能。\n力量训练则有助于增加肌肉量，从而在静止状态下消耗更多热量，塑造紧致线条。\n饮食方面应遵循均衡原则，增加优质蛋白质、膳食纤维及全谷物的摄入比例。\n严格控制添加糖、精制碳水及高加工食品的摄取，同时保持充足的水分补充。\n关于睡眠，许多人误以为熬夜能增加消耗，实则睡眠不足会扰乱激素，导致食欲失控。\n保证每晚七至八小时的高质量睡眠，是调节代谢、抑制饥饿感并促进恢复的关键环节。","tokens":[],"id_slot":0,"stop":true,"model":"/home/kunweiz/models/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-APEX-I-Compact/Qwen3.8-Flash-Next-APEX-I-Compact-00001-of-00006.gguf","tokens_predicted":171,"tokens_evaluated":19,"generation_settings":{"seed":42,"temperature":0.0,"dynatemp_range":0.0,"dynatemp_exponent":1.0,"top_k":20,"top_p":0.949999988079071,"min_p":0.05000000074505806,"top_n_sigma":-1.0,"xtc_probability":0.0,"xtc_threshold":0.10000000149011612,"typical_p":1.0,"repeat_last_n":64,"repeat_penalty":1.0,"presence_penalty":0.0,"frequency_penalty":0.0,"dry_multiplier":0.0,"dry_base":1.75,"dry_allowed_length":2,"dry_penalty_last_n":512,"dry_sequence_breakers":["\n",":","\"","*"],"mirostat":0,"mirostat_tau":5.0,"mirostat_eta":0.10000000149011612,"adaptive_target":-1.0,"adaptive_decay":0.8999999761581421,"stop":[],"max_tokens":175,"n_predict":175,"n_keep":0,"n_discard":0,"ignore_eos":false,"stream":false,"logit_bias":[],"n_probs":0,"min_keep":0,"grammar":"","grammar_lazy":false,"grammar_triggers":[],"preserved_tokens":[],"chat_format":"Content-only","reasoning_format":"deepseek","reasoning_effort":"","reasoning_budget_tokens":-1,"reasoning_in_content":false,"generation_prompt":"","samplers":["penalties","dry","top_n_sigma","top_k","typ_p","top_p","min_p","xtc","temperature"],"speculative.types":"none,draft-mtp","timings_per_token":false,"post_sampling_probs":false,"backend_sampling":false,"lora":[],"rerot_enabled":false,"rerot_frontier":"strong","rerot_trace":false},"prompt":"请用八句话简要介绍健康减重原则、每周运动安排、饮食建议和睡眠误区。","has_new_line":true,"truncated":false,"stop_type":"eos","stopping_word":"","tokens_cached":189,"timings":{"cache_n":15,"prompt_n":4,"prompt